    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Daily Briefing Bot\n\nFetches top stories from 3 RSS feeds each morning, summarizes them with a local Ollama model, and posts a morning briefing to your Slack channel.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Trigger fires at 08:00 daily\n2. TechCrunch, Hacker News, and n8n Blog are fetched in parallel\n3. All articles are merged into a single stream\n4. Summarization Chain distills each article to one bullet point, then combines them into a single briefing\n5. Briefing is posted to Slack",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "59a04b05-6ef3-40c6-b7e4-7cb43100a0c0",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prerequisites\n\n**Ollama** running locally with model pulled:\n- `qwen2.5:7b` \u2014 runs the summarization\n- Pull with: `ollama pull qwen2.5:7b`\n- Default URL: `http://localhost:11434`\n\n**Slack** credential connected in n8n:\n- Create a Slack App \u2192 Bot Token (xoxb-...)\n- Invite the bot to your target channel before activating",
        "height": 274,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b4ef158b-6ce5-4e0d-9d6d-a8063dd1d667",
      "name": "Prerequisites",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        -304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuration\n\n**1. Slack channel**\nIn *Post Daily Briefing*, replace `YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID` with your channel ID.\n\u2192 Right-click channel in Slack \u2192 Copy link \u2192 the last segment is the ID (e.g. `C0ABC12345`)\n\n**2. Schedule**\nChange the trigger time in *Daily 08:00 Trigger* (default: 08:00 daily)\n\n**3. Swap RSS feeds**\nReplace any URL in the three Fetch nodes with your preferred sources",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 490,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "96253c62-9e26-4eb4-ae70-031073f5324a",
      "name": "Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        896,
        560
      ]
    }
  ],
